    "title": "Warehouse closing triggers layoffs for 62 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Christopher Bjorke ,\n10 hours ago The closing of a hardware distribution center in Springfield will trigger the layoff of 62 workers, according to a filing with the state of Oregon on Wednesday. Impact Outsourcing Solutions notified Oregon worker adjustment and retraining officials that its employees assigned to the TV Hardware Distribution facility will lose their jobs with site's closing this fall. Read full article",
